{
  "info": {
    "name": "Search Service - Admin API",
    "description": "Admin search endpoints for the Giga platform Search Service.\n\nThese endpoints require authentication and specific roles:\n- **Moderator**: users, vendors, bookings, orders\n- **Admin**: drivers, transactions, rides\n\nBase URL: `{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/search/admin`",
    "version": "2.2.0",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{authToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3004",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "authToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Search Users",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"q\": \"\",\n  \"email\": \"\",\n  \"phone\": \"\",\n  \"is_active\": true,\n  \"is_phone_verified\": null,\n  \"state\": \"\",\n  \"page\": 1,\n  \"limit\": 20,\n  \"sort\": \"created_at\",\n  \"order\": \"desc\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/search/admin/users",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "search", "admin", "users"]
            },
            "description": "Search user profiles with filters.\n\n**Required Role**: Moderator or Admin\n\n**Filters**:\n- `q`: Search query (name, email, phone)\n- `email`: Filter by email\n- `phone`: Filter by phone\n- `is_active`: Filter by active status\n- `is_phone_verified`: Filter by verification\n- `state`: Filter by state/region"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Search Users - By Email",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"page\": 1,\n  \"limit\": 20\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/search/admin/users",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "search", "admin", "users"]
            },
            "description": "Search users by email address"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Search Users - Inactive",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"is_active\": false,\n  \"page\": 1,\n  \"limit\": 50\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/search/admin/users",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "search", "admin", "users"]
            },
            "description": "Find all inactive users"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "User profile search endpoints (Moderator access)"
    },
