              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "search", "admin", "transactions"]
            },
            "description": "Search payment transactions with filters.\n\n**Required Role**: Admin only (sensitive financial data)\n\n**Note**: All access is logged for audit purposes.\n\n**Filters**:\n- `reference`: Filter by payment reference\n- `user_id`: Filter by user UUID\n- `payment_method`: card, bank, ussd, etc.\n- `payment_status`: pending, success, failed, refunded\n- `module_name`: hotel_booking, ecommerce, taxi, etc.\n- `min_amount/max_amount`: Amount range"
          },
          "response": []
